OL,3,GNEWSAThe man who bought an island,
OL,4,Ahired hitmen and throttled a
OL,5,Atheatregoer
OL,6,
OL,7,FTheatre-lover Kirsty O'Donnell was a
OL,8,Fregular visitor to the West End to
OL,9,Fenjoy musicals and plays.
OL,11,FBut her life took a dramatic and
OL,12,Ffrightening turn during a performance
OL,13,Fof Queen musical We Will Rock You at
OL,14,Fthe London Coliseum.
OL,16,FShe was throttled by the stranger
OL,17,Fsitting next to her ` a disgraced
OL,18,Fex-millionaire who had twice tried to
OL,19,Fhave his former partner murdered.
